.expo/
.export-check/
dist/
*.local

# Leading slashes matter: these ignore `expo prebuild` output at the project root ONLY. Written as `android/`
# and `ios/` they match any directory of that name at any depth, which silently excluded this app's own native
# module (modules/qb-frames/android) from both git and the EAS upload — the module was missing from a build that
# still reported success, so the feature simply did nothing on the device.
/android/
/ios/
